+Find exactly {r} landmark vertices such that every unordered pair of distinct
+graph vertices is distinguished by at least k={inst['k']} different selected
+landmarks. This is called a 2-metric generator. The selected vertices must be
+distinct. Mathematically their order is irrelevant, but the output must list
+them in strictly increasing order as a unique encoding.
