codex
The first run exposed an important G4 correction: the graph rule makes one member of the pair—the public image of canonical index \(n-1\)—free to deduce. I’m tightening the candidate prior to always include that vertex, so guessing ranges only over the unknown partner. The shipping size is raised to keep this structure-aware probability below \(10^{-6}\).
