+Section 1 supplies the exact definition. Theorem 2.2 identifies the maximum
+`k` as `min |D_G(x,y)|`, and Corollary 2.3 says that a connected graph is
+2-metric dimensional exactly when it contains twins. This corollary is also the
+easy-result warning: Track A would be false. On Track B, forward enumeration of
+the affine-chain preimage is the reference algorithm. It is
+`O(n * rounds)` and, on shipping seed 314159, scanned 868,376 coordinates and
+performed 31,261,542 modular operations in 0.869 seconds. The compact route
+reverses 12 updates and maps two canonical coordinates to public labels, at
+most 78 exact arithmetic operations.
 
