codex
The independent explicit-graph audit passed 20/20, including connectivity, unique false twins, and a direct recomputation of Theorem 2.2’s minimum. I found one conservative accounting issue before finalizing: deriving all modular inverses can push the intended route over 300 if every extended-Euclid coefficient update is counted separately. I’ll publish and validate the inverse exponents/multipliers as part of each reversible update; the insight remains “reverse the bijections,” while the post-insight arithmetic count becomes unambiguously below the cap.
apply patch
