The final artifacts now correspond to the final rendered problem. All three harnesses remain quota-blocked with zero scored attempts, so the bundle is correctly marked “not shippable yet,” not rejected and not hardened. I’m running final schema/determinism/hint-mode checks and verifying the retained reports are parseable.
